{"schema":"hsr-localizations.v1","entryId":"other-message-p7469","chapterId":"sadac5a30345c5c1d","language":"zh-CN","referenceCommit":"74a7b96fba32f00cf495a5c00b0311bd02207aaf","rows":[{"id":"other-message-p7469-bcc9fe357d71ea779b1c","text":"今天战况如何呀？","speaker":"三月七"},{"id":"other-message-p7469-08efc2360d3f8d14a692","text":"（展示照片）","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-ce50b15e0ed2f281d610","text":"辛苦啦！","speaker":"三月七"},{"id":"other-message-p7469-5268ad34462a00484e23","text":"不过…好像和我当时拍的不太一样？","speaker":"三月七"},{"id":"other-message-p7469-18215e7d05728bfba72d","text":"应该没什么区别","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-cf6d2599a759bb1ab918","text":"看起来没什么区别啊","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-6e0434fb8136f598bbc2","text":"唔，可能是我记不清了吧","speaker":"三月七"},{"id":"other-message-p7469-bae2eac70cfd7d9132c8","text":"但我肯定没有拍过两个扑满这么奇怪的东西…","speaker":"三月七"},{"id":"other-message-p7469-b801c784ac6af7500c13","text":"时过境迁，物是人非…","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-e1e21a6f9330e2320a19","text":"时过境迁，物是人非…","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-886965c69a42a2a64a2d","text":"你说得好伤感哦！","speaker":"三月七"},{"id":"other-message-p7469-ffa0c299871544b05cff","text":"对了，我这边的收集也快结束了","speaker":"三月七"},{"id":"other-message-p7469-4632928c0ebc2f49b4ac","text":"还剩下最后两张照片了，就交给你了！","speaker":"三月七"}]}
